Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:25:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add demo-plugin-maintain global capability

Admins want to take demo-plugin into maintenance without restarting
Gerrit. Only a dedicated group may do that, so define a plugin-owned
global capability first; nothing checks it yet.
